<section class="services-section" id="services">
  <div class="services-header r">
    <div class="tag">What We Execute</div>
    <h1>Full scope interior<br>execution.</h1>
    <p>From first swing of the hammer to the final piece of millwork, we handle every trade under one roof so nothing slips through the cracks.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="services-masonry stagger">
    <div class="svc-card r">
      <span class="svc-num">01</span>
      <h2>Demolition</h2>
      <p>Complete strip outs and selective demo. We clear the way fast and clean so your project starts on the front foot, not the back one.</p>
      <ul class="svc-bullets">
        <li>Full interior strip-out to base building</li>
        <li>Selective demolition to drawings</li>
        <li>Hazardous material coordination</li>
        <li>Complete debris removal and disposal</li>
        <li>Site protection for adjacent tenants</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="svc-differentiator"><p>We have never left a site dirty at end of day. That is not a policy, it is a habit. A clean demo site is faster to frame.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-card r">
      <span class="svc-num">02</span>
      <h2>Walls &amp; Ceilings</h2>
      <p>Steel framing, drywall, taping, ceiling systems. Precision work that is ready for finishing on time, every time.</p>
      <ul class="svc-bullets">
        <li>Steel stud framing to drawings</li>
        <li>Drywall hang, tape, and Level 4 finish</li>
        <li>T-bar acoustic ceiling systems</li>
        <li>Gypsum board ceilings and bulkheads</li>
        <li>Backing for all wall-mounted items</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="svc-differentiator"><p>Our taping crews are in-house. That means schedule control and finish consistency — not a sub who disappears when you need a re-coat.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-card r">
      <span class="svc-num">03</span>
      <h2>Finishing</h2>
      <p>Paint, trim, flooring, final touches. This is where the design comes to life and we make sure every surface reflects the quality your client expects.</p>
      <ul class="svc-bullets">
        <li>Painting in all sheens and finishes</li>
        <li>Trim, base, and door casing installation</li>
        <li>LVP, carpet tile, ceramic and porcelain tile</li>
        <li>Caulking, touch-up, and punch-list close</li>
        <li>Final sign-off walkthrough standard</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="svc-differentiator"><p>We do not call a project done until the client walks it. Punch lists get closed, not carried. Every open item is resolved before keys exchange.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-card r">
      <span class="svc-num">04</span>
      <h2>Millwork &amp; Install</h2>
      <p>Custom millwork, cabinetry, fixtures, built ins. Placed exactly to spec with zero guesswork and zero callbacks.</p>
      <ul class="svc-bullets">
        <li>Custom reception desks and counters</li>
        <li>Built-in cabinetry and shelving</li>
        <li>Fixture and hardware installation</li>
        <li>Long-lead ordering managed from day one</li>
        <li>Field verification before fabrication begins</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="svc-differentiator"><p>We measure twice. Every piece is verified against drawings before it leaves the shop. We have zero tolerance for a millwork item that doesn't fit.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-card big r">
      <div>
        <span class="svc-num">05</span>
        <h2>Trade Coordination &amp; Scaling</h2>
        <p>We manage the flow of multiple trades, keep schedules tight, and scale manpower when the timeline demands it. Weekend pushes, extended crews, whatever it takes. Your deadline does not move.</p>
        <ul class="svc-bullets">
          <li>Multi-trade sequencing and conflict resolution</li>
          <li>Electrical, plumbing, and HVAC coordination</li>
          <li>Surge crew deployment for recovery</li>
          <li>Weekend and extended shift capability</li>
          <li>Single point of accountability for all trades</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="svc-differentiator"><p>We own the schedule. If a trade slips, we adjust the sequence rather than let the delay compound. You hear about the problem and the recovery plan at the same time.</p></div>
      </div>
